<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-FRANCE BEAT PORTUGAL 2-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRANCE BEAT PORTUGAL 2-0.</headline>
<dateline>BRAGA, Portugal 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>France beat Portugal 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in a friendly international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>France - Didier Deschamps 10, Ibrahima Ba 60.</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
